  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme Support to Office of the Auditor General in Zambia (2022-2025)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programst&#xf6;d till Zambias Riksrevision (2022-2025)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Riksrevisorns uppgifter &#xe4;r att granska r&#xe4;kenskaperna f&#xf6;r statliga organ, statliga institutioner, landskapsf&#xf6;rvaltningen, lokala myndigheter och andra institutioner som finansieras med offentliga medel. OAG:s uppdrag &#xe4;r att tillhandah&#xe5;lla revisionstj&#xe4;nster av h&#xf6;g kvalitet i r&#xe4;tt tid f&#xf6;r att fr&#xe4;mja transparens och ansvarighet i f&#xf6;rvaltningen av offentliga resurser f&#xf6;r medborgarnas v&#xe4;lbefinnande&#x201d;. Detta bidrag &#xe4;r t&#xe4;nkt att st&#xf6;dja ansvarsskyldighet och minska korruptionen i Zambia genom OAG.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The functions of the Auditor General are to audit the accounts of State Organs, State institutions, Provincial Administration, Local Authorities and other institutions financed from public funds. The mission of OAG is to provide timely quality audit services to promote transparency and accountability in the management of public resources for the well-being of the citizenry&#x201d;. This contribution is meant to support accountability and reduce corruption in Zambia through the OAG.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The functions of the Auditor General are to audit the accounts of State Organs, State institutions, Provincial Administration, Local Authorities and other institutions financed from public funds. The mission of OAG is to provide timely quality audit services to promote transparency and accountability in the management of public resources for the well-being of the citizenry.

The 2022  2026 Strategic Plan provides for six (6) objectives:

1. Improve audit services

2. Improve stakeholder engagement

3. Enhance resource mobilization and management

4. Improve operational systems and procedures

5. Enhance human capital

6. Improve infrastructure, tools and equipment</narrative>
  </description>
